  "story": {
    "day": 54,
    "title": "Kaya's Summer Visit",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya got up early one summer day.",
      "She planned to see her cousin, Yumi.",
      "First, Kaya got on the train.",
      "She got off at the third station.",
      "Soon, she got to Yumi's house.",
      "Yumi's mom, Ms. Sato, opened the door.",
      "Yumi was very friendly and kind.",
      "They shared a soft, sweet apple. \"It isn't sour!\" Yumi said.",
      "They talked about dreams: a nurse, a pilot, an office worker, so on.",
      "Kaya loved soccer, and Yumi liked basketball.",
      "\"Yes, these are lovely ideas!\" Ms. Sato said. \"You can speak freely.\"",
      "\"There aren't any funny jobs. All are beautiful and great.\" Kaya smiled."
    ]
  }
}